{"id":"u-d7dd0624-e4ce-440e-94b8-30c29d6ff1a1","src":"community","title":"Twan THE GRAVESLAYER bulk2.0 (10 day program)","author":"Twan ten Hooven","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/rDmprf-twan-the-graveslayer-bulk20-10-day-program","desc":"Deze 5 dagen verdelen over 10 weken. \n\nVerdeel je rustdagen zoals je wilt maar houdt rekening met: \n\nCHEST + BACK mag achter elkaar aan (na back wil je vaak rust) \n\nSCHOUDER + ARMEN + LEGS mag achter elkaar aan\n\nWat hierboven dus niet staat mag NIET achter elkaar aan. \n\nDISCLAIMER: \n\nHET IS EEN 10 DAGEN PROGRAMMA MAAR HET HOEFT NIET IN 10 DAGEN. ALS JE EERDER KLAAR BENT MAG JE HEM OPNIEUW BEGINNEN, LET ALLEEN OP DE BOVENSTAANDE COMBO'S QUA DAGEN ACHTER ELKAAR EN JE BENT GOED. STEL JE HEBT EEN DRUK SCHEMA OF VAKANTIE KAN JE DUS MEER DAN 2 RUSTDAGEN PAKKEN DOORDAT DIT EEN 10 DAGEN PROGRAMMA IS. ENJOY GRAVESLAYER!","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-03-14T16:07:39.838Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["CHEST","BACK","SCHOUDERS","ARMEN","LEGS + ABS"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6},{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":10,"hi":15}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6},{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Wrist Curls","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":0,"hi":5},{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}],"note":"5/3/1 SYSTEEM\n\nEERSTE 10 DAGEN 5\nTWEEDE 10 DAGEN 3\nDERDE 10 DAGEN 1 ORM"},{"n":"Pull-Up (Neutral Grip, Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":6},{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}],"note":"ZORG WEL EERST DAT JE 10 ZONDER WEIGHT KAN"},{"n":"Pullover (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"High Row","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Shrug (Trap Bar)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"x":3}],"note":"HEEL ZWAAR\n\nRUST